&lt;p&gt;The Partner Sales Manager is a &quot;hunter&quot; role focused on accelerating &lt;strong&gt;Partner Sourced pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; and revenue growth within a specific geographic territory. You will be responsible for the end-to-end activation of Value-Added Resellers (VARs) and Managed Service Providers (MSPs), shifting our posture from &quot;partners on paper&quot; to active, strategic revenue generators. &lt;strong&gt;With a key focus on SCC, Atos and Cap Gemini in France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By driving deep penetration into partner organizations, you will establish a fair exchange of value where partners source new opportunities and are also brought into direct sales motions to provide technical expertise and value add support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive net-new pipeline through deal registrations, evidenced by high-impact sales plays and industry-specific solutions to our ICP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve existing tactical relationships into purposeful and intentional partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Account Penetration:&lt;/strong&gt; Build senior-level relationships and establish a presence within partner organizations to pivot their sales posture toward New Relic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Technical Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate sales and technical enablement to ensure partners are certified and capable of evangelizing the value of Intelligent Observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Continually coach internal sales teams and leadership on partnering best practices to foster a positive channel culture and increase collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in French and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter who operates with urgency and thrives in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; Someone who enjoys creating structure and driving change within a business unit that is scaling rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Capable of building working relationships with executives both inside and outside the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilient &amp;amp; Results-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to manage competing priorities and aggressive timelines while maintaining a growth mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
