&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and consult with business stakeholders to identify and define requirements, design and build complex, performant business-critical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize core Service Cloud features, including Omni-Channel, Lightning Service Console, Case Management, Entitlements, Milestones, Salesforce Knowledge and Experience Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build robust, highly scalable integrations between Salesforce and complex third-party enterprise systems (e.g., CTI/telephony systems, Jira &amp;amp; other external systems).&lt;/li&gt;
