&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Computer Science, Management Information Systems or the equivalent related experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on development in Salesforce development, includes &lt;strong&gt;Service Cloud &amp;amp; Experience Cloud, &lt;/strong&gt;from business requirements assessment to solutions as well as coordinating/leading solution design, development/configuration, and deployment using Salesforce Service Cloud features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Omni Channel, Chat, Entitlements and Milestones.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Salesforce Development experience (Apex, Trigger, Lightning Web Components and SOQL/SOQL) with proven track record of successful project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
