&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in a fast-paced environment focused on delivering high-quality production code at a regular cadence using Agile methodologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
