&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Technical Support Manager to cultivate and lead a collaborative, deeply technical engineering team dedicated to delivering an exceptional, memorable customer experience. Working closely with the Vice President of EMEA &amp;amp; APJ Support Engineering, this leader will hold accountability for their team&#39;s operational goals while partnering across the wider customer experience landscape, including Engineering, Product, and Go-To-Market (GTM) teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our management team thrives on a foundation of equity, growth, and intersectional diversity. We are committed to building an environment where everyone can bring their authentic selves to work. We value leaders who possess a track record of learning from complex challenges, fostering positive culture, and showing deep dedication to the success of others.&lt;/p&gt;
