&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower &amp;amp; Develop:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and mentor a highly skilled team of support engineers, facilitating individual career progression and fostering a team dynamic where everyone has the opportunity to do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide day-to-day operations to ensure team structures adapt dynamically to evolving customer and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the global Support Management cohort to collectively achieve service level objectives and champion initiatives that drive customer satisfaction and supportability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate for the Customer:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a dependable point of contact for customer escalations, ensuring critical issues are effectively resourced, investigated, and brought to a timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Progress:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-functional programs and projects, iterating on operational strategies to simplify processes and deliver high-impact business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Continuity:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in an on-call rotation to maintain premier service delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Management Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in leading people, nurturing talent, and running operational strategies for responsive technical support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive Leadership Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; A clear dedication to cultivating a supportive, positive culture where metrics are balanced with employee satisfaction and collaborative growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in gathering, interpreting, and leveraging data to identify systemic problems, optimize workflows, and drive continuous process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong interpersonal and coaching skills, with the ability to bridge technical complexities and business requirements while bringing teams along on strategic journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience navigating enterprise operational platforms and customer support ecosystems (such as Salesforce, ServiceCloud, Google Workspace, or Tableau).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing support delivery within a high-tech, fast-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capability collaborating with international or multi-functional stakeholders to align product roadmaps with customer health indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software industry trends, modern observability solutions, or Application Performance Management (APM) systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
